uality and designs.</span></span></strong><br><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">• Payment terms: Hiflyer Jewels will be paying out<span style=\"color:rgb(224,62,45);\"> within 48hrs</span> of orders received.</span></strong><br><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(45,194,107);\"><strong>Highest performing affiliates gets amazing gifts from the brand in forms of international vacations, merchandise, jewelry etc.</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">WELOMING YOU ALL TO THE HIFLYERS' CLUB.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">\"IF YOU AIN'T OUR OWN CELEBRITY, WHO'LL BE ?\"</p></div>",
